Subject: [PATCH 111/111] OAuth Support For SMTP

---
 auth-client.c | 77 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 auth-client.h |  1 +
 base64.c      | 24 +++++++++++++
 base64.h      |  2 +-
 meson.build   |  3 +-
 smtp-auth.c   | 97 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
